  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Deepwoken Grand sudaruska autocombo (2bars-3bars)</Major>
    <Description>Hello, this macro is for the Roblox game Deepwoken and it basically does the combo for frost and gran sudaruska automatically!

First, you need to have ice lance on 1, then ice eruption on 2, and make sure you have your weapon in the weapon slot in 6 or above.

HOW TO USE: 1st you need to parry their attack, then activate it, it's quick so hard to parry this combo!

Enjoy :)

(I'LL BE MAKING MORE MACROS FOR ROBLOX)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
